      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This guide helps you migrate from the deprecated <code>FunctionCallback</code> API to the new <code>ToolCallback</code> API in Spring AI. For more information about the new APIs, check out the <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"tools.html\">Tools Calling</a> documentation.",
      "translation": "本指南将帮助您从已弃用的 <code>FunctionCallback</code> API 迁移到 Spring AI 中的新 <code>ToolCallback</code> API。有关新 API 的更多信息，请查看 <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"tools.html\">Tools Calling</a> 文档。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>method()</code> configuration in function callbacks has been replaced with a more explicit method tool configuration using <code>ToolDefinition</code> and <code>MethodToolCallback</code>.",
      "translation": "函数回调中的 <code>method()</code> 配置已被替换为使用 <code>ToolDefinition</code> 和 <code>MethodToolCallback</code> 的更显式的 method 工具配置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When using method-based callbacks, you now need to explicitly find the method using <code>ReflectionUtils</code> and provide it to the builder. Alternatively, you can use the declarative approach with the <code>@Tool</code> annotation.",
      "translation": "在使用基于方法的回调时，您现在需要使用 <code>ReflectionUtils</code> 显式查找该方法并将其提供给 builder。或者，您也可以使用带有 <code>@Tool</code> 注解的声明式方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "And you can use the same <code>ChatClient#tools()</code> API to register method-based tool callbacks:",
      "translation": "您还可以使用相同的 <code>ChatClient#tools()</code> API 来注册基于方法的工具回调：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Use their <code>tools</code> counterparts instead.",
      "translation": "请改用它们的 <code style=\"color:red;\">tools</code> 对应项。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Now you can use the method-level annotation (<code>@Tool</code>) to register tools with Spring AI:",
      "translation": "现在，您可以使用方法级注解（<code>@Tool</code>）来向 Spring AI 注册工具：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "These changes are part of a broader effort to improve and extend the tool calling capabilities in Spring AI. Among the other things, the new API moves from \"functions\" to \"tools\" terminology to better align with industry conventions. This involves several API changes while maintaining backward compatibility through deprecated methods.",
      "translation": "这些变化是旨在改进和扩展 Spring AI 工具调用能力的一项更广泛工作的组成部分。除此之外，新的 API 从“functions”转向“tools”术语，以更好地符合行业惯例。这涉及若干 API 变更，同时通过弃用的方法保持向后兼容性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For non-static methods, you must now provide both the method and the target object:",
      "translation": "对于非静态方法，您现在必须同时提供方法和目标对象：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following methods are deprecated and will be removed in a future release:",
      "translation": "以下方法已弃用，并将在未来的版本中移除：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The new API provides better separation between tool definition and implementation.",
      "translation": "新的 API 在工具定义与实现之间提供了更好的分离。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Tool definitions can be reused across different implementations.",
      "translation": "工具定义可以在不同的实现中重复使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The builder pattern has been simplified for common use cases.",
      "translation": "建造者模式已针对常见用例进行了简化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Better support for method-based tools with improved error handling.",
      "translation": "对基于方法的工具提供更好的支持，并改进了错误处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The deprecated methods will be maintained for backward compatibility in the current milestone version but will be removed in the next milestone release. It’s recommended to migrate to the new API as soon as possible.",
      "translation": "弃用的方法将在当前的里程碑版本中保留以确保向后兼容，但将在下一个里程碑版本中移除。建议尽快迁移到新的 API。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
